# CareerOS — Phase 3: Unified Database, Data Ownership & Persistent User State

You are continuing work on the CareerOS codebase after Phase 1 and Phase 2.

## OBJECTIVE

Complete **Phase 3: Unified Database & Persistence**.

The goal is to make MongoDB Atlas the **single source of truth for all important CareerOS user data**.

After this phase, a user must be able to:

```text
Register/Login
      ↓
Evaluate skills
      ↓
Refresh browser
      ↓
Skills still exist

Generate roadmap
      ↓
Refresh browser
      ↓
Roadmap still exists

Generate course
      ↓
Enroll
      ↓
Complete modules
      ↓
Refresh browser
      ↓
Progress still exists

Logout
      ↓
Login again
      ↓
All user data still exists
```

The browser must no longer be responsible for permanently storing CareerOS application data.

