# 3. TARGET DATA ARCHITECTURE

The target architecture is:

```text
                    CareerOS User
                         │
                         │ User._id
                         ▼
                 ┌───────────────┐
                 │   MongoDB     │
                 │    Atlas      │
                 └───────┬───────┘
                         │
          ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
          ▼              ▼              ▼
       Skills         Roadmaps        Courses
          │              │              │
          │              │              ▼
          │              │         Enrollments
          │              │              │
          │              │              ▼
          │              │           Progress
          │              │
          └──────────────┴──────────────┐
                                       ▼
                              CareerOS Dashboard
```

MongoDB must be the authoritative source for:

* User profile
* Skill evaluations
* Skill profile
* Roadmaps
* Courses
* Course enrollment
* Course progress
* Roadmap progress
* Evaluation history
* Completion state
* Relevant generated artifacts

