```

and the Phase 0 verification sends:

```json
{
  "courseModules": 3
}
```

The Phase 1 report explicitly identifies this as a real implementation/schema mismatch.

Resolve this deliberately.

First determine what the application actually needs:

### If it needs a count:

Use:

```text
